column2:
I[f] you demand the Bull [of me,]
104	the widow of Uruk must gathe[r] seven years of chaff;
105	[the farmer of Uruk] must g[r]ow seven years of ha[y.]

[ ... ] I have stored away(?);
109	[ ... ] I have laid in:
110	the wid[ow of Uruk has gath]ered [seven ye]ars of chaff;
111	the farm[er of Uruk has grown] the hay.
